			   <fo:block>The Death or Disability Extended Reporting Period:</fo:block>
				<fo:block>(1)&#160;&#160; will apply only to such <fo:inline font-weight="bold">Insured</fo:inline> as an individual accountant; and</fo:block>
				<fo:block>(2)&#160;&#160;will not apply to any
