					The
					<fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-style="italic">Insurer</fo:inline>
					will reimburse the
					<fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-style="italic">Named Insured
					</fo:inline>
					up to $20,000 for
					<fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-style="italic">Crisis
						Event Expenses
					</fo:inline>
					that result from a
					<fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-style="italic">Crisis Event
					</fo:inline>
					first occurring during the <fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-style="italic">Policy Period.</fo:inline> Such event shall be reported
					in writing to the <fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-style="italic">Insurer</fo:inline> pursuant to Section VI., General Condition
					A., Notice of <fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-style="italic">Claim</fo:inline> or Circumstance. Any payments made regarding such
					event will be:</fo:block>
				<fo:block>1.&#160;&#160; in addition to the Limit of
				Liability; and</fo:block>
				
				 <fo:block>2.&#160;&#160; are not subject to the Deductible.</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-body>
			</fo:list-item>
			</fo:list-block>
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-body>
			</fo:list-item>
			</fo:list-block>
			</fo:block>    
			
			
			<fo:block margin-top="4mm">
			<fo:list-block>
			<fo:list-item space-after="4mm">
			<fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:block>
				9.
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:list-item-body start-indent="7mm">
			<fo:block space-after="4mm">
				Section IV., Definitions, Insured, is deleted in its entirety and replaced with the following:
			</fo:block>
			<fo:block>
				<fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-style="italic">Insured</fo:inline> means:
			</fo:block>
			
			
			<fo:block>
			<fo:list-block>
			
			<fo:list-item>
			<fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:block>
				(a)
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:list-item-body start-indent="14mm">
			<fo:block>
			 the <fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-style="italic">Named Insured</fo:inline>;
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-body>
			</fo:list-item>
			
			<fo:list-item>
			<fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:block>
				(b)
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:list-item-body start-indent="14mm">
			<fo:block>
			 <fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-style="italic">Predecessor Firm;</fo:inline>
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-body>
			</fo:list-item>
			
			<fo:list-item>
			<fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:block>
				(c)
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:list-item-body start-indent="14mm">
			<fo:block>
			any present or future: (1) principal; (2) partner; (3) director; (4) officer; (5) member; or (6) employee of the <fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-style="italic"> Named Insured;</fo:inline>
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-body>
			</fo:list-item>
			<fo:list-item>
			<fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:block>
				(d)
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:list-item-body start-indent="14mm">
			<fo:block>
				any former: (1) principal; (2) partner; (3) director; (4) officer; (5) member; (6) or employee of the  <fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-style="italic">Named Insured</fo:inline> or of a <fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-style="italic">Predecessor Firm</fo:inline>;
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-body>
			</fo:list-item>
			<fo:list-item>
			<fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:block>
				(e)
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:list-item-body start-indent="14mm">
			<fo:block>
				the: (1) estate; (2) heirs; (3) executors; (4) administrators; (5) assigns; and (6) legal representatives of an <fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-style="italic">Insured</fo:inline> but only in the event of such <fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-style="italic">Insured’s:</fo:inline>
			</fo:block>
			<fo:block>(i)&#160;&#160;death;</fo:block>
			<fo:block>(ii)&#160;&#160;incapacity;</fo:block>
			<fo:block>(iii)&#160;&#160;insolvency; or</fo:block>
			<fo:block>(iv)&#160;&#160;bankruptcy; and</fo:block>
			
				<fo:block>only to the extent
				that such <fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-style="italic">Insured</fo:inline> would otherwise have been provided coverage under the
				terms, conditions and exclusions of this policy; and
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-body>
			</fo:list-item>
			<fo:list-item>
			<fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:block>
				(f)
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:list-item-body start-indent="14mm">
			<fo:block>
			    any: (1) contract; or (2) temporary employee of a  <fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-style="italic">Named Insured</fo:inline> under the direct supervision of an <fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-style="italic">Insured</fo:inline>;
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-body>
			</fo:list-item>
			</fo:list-block>
			</fo:block>
			<fo:block margin-top="3mm">
				but only with respect to <fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-style="italic">Professional Services</fo:inline> performed within the
				scope of their duties on behalf of the <fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-style="italic">Named Insured</fo:inline> or <fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-style="italic">Predecessor
				Firm</fo:inline>.
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-body>
			</fo:list-item>
			</fo:list-block>
			</fo:block>
			<fo:block margin-top="10mm"/>
             <fo:block  font-size="10px" color="grey" text-align="left">ISMIE AAA-04-F005 (04012022)
       	 		<fo:block margin-top="-0.5cm" font-size="10px" color="grey" text-align="right">Page 3 of 5</fo:block>
       	 	</fo:block>
			<fo:block break-after="page"></fo:block>
			
			<fo:block text-align="center" color="grey" font-size="12px" font-weight="bold">THIS ENDORSEMENT CHANGES THE POLICY, Please READ IT CAREFULLY.</fo:block>
			<fo:block margin-top="10mm"/>  
			<fo:block>
	     <fo:list-block>
			<fo:list-item space-after="4mm">
			<fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:block>
				10.
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:list-item-body start-indent="7mm">
			<fo:block>
				Section IV., Definitions, <fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-style="italic">Predecessor Firm</fo:inline>, is:</fo:block>
				
				
				
			<fo:block>a.&#160;&#160; deleted in its entirety; and</fo:block>
			
			 <fo:block space-after="4mm">b.&#160;&#160; replaced with the following:</fo:block>
			<fo:block start-indent="14mm"> <fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-style="italic">Predecessor Firm</fo:inline> means an:</fo:block>
				
				<fo:block start-indent="14mm">(a)&#160;&#160;partnership;</fo:block>
				<fo:block start-indent="14mm">(b)&#160;&#160;professional corporation;</fo:block>
				<fo:block start-indent="14mm">(c)&#160;&#160;professional association;</fo:block>
				<fo:block start-indent="14mm">(d)&#160;&#160;limited liability corporation; or</fo:block>
				<fo:block start-indent="14mm">(e)&#160;&#160;partnership;</fo:block>
				
				<fo:block space-after="4mm">which was at all times engaged in <fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-style="italic">Professional Services</fo:inline> and
				to whose financial assets and liabilities the <fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-style="italic">Named Insured</fo:inline> is the
				majority successor in interest prior to the effective date shown in
				Item 2. of the Declarations.
			</fo:block>
			<fo:block><fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-style="italic">Predecessor Firm</fo:inline> does not include any:</fo:block>
			
			<fo:block>(a)&#160;&#160;individual;</fo:block>
			<fo:block>(b)&#160;&#160;partnership;</fo:block>
			<fo:block>(c)&#160;&#160;professional corporation;</fo:block>
			<fo:block>(d)&#160;&#160;professional association;</fo:block>
			<fo:block>(e)&#160;&#160;limited liability corporation; or</fo:block>
			<fo:block>(f)&#160;&#160;partnership;</fo:block>
						
			
			   <fo:block>which was: (1) at all times engaged in 
				<fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-style="italic">Professional Services;</fo:inline> and (2) to whose financial assets and liabilities the
				<fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-style="italic">Named Insured</fo:inline> becomes the majority successor in interest after the
				effective date of this policy shown in Item 2. of the Declarations,
				unless the <fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-style="italic">Insurer</fo:inline> agrees to include such
				entity. Should the <fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-style="italic">Insurer</fo:inline> agree to include such entity it may do so
				for an additional premium or with amended policy terms and conditions.
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-body>
			</fo:list-item>
			<fo:list-item space-after="4mm">
			<fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:block>
				11.
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:list-item-body start-indent="7mm">
			<fo:block space-after="4mm">
				Section IV., Definitions, is amended by addition of the following:
			</fo:block>
			<fo:block>
			<fo:list-block>
			<fo:list-item space-after="4mm">
			<fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:block font-weight="bold">
				•
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:list-item-body start-indent="14mm">
			<fo:block>
				<fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-style="italic">Crisis Event</fo:inline> means:
			</fo:block>
			<fo:block>
			<fo:list-block>
			<fo:list-item>
			<fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:block>
				(a)
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:list-item-body start-indent="21mm">
			<fo:block>
				death, departure or debilitating illness of a principal <fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-style="italic">Insured</fo:inline>;
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-body>
			</fo:list-item>
			<fo:list-item>
			<fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:block>
				(b)
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:list-item-body start-indent="21mm">
			<fo:block>
				dissolution of the <fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-style="italic">Named Insured</fo:inline>; or
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-body>
			</fo:list-item>
			<fo:list-item>
			<fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:block>
				(c)
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:list-item-body start-indent="21mm">
			<fo:block>
				incident of workplace violence;
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-body>
			</fo:list-item>
			</fo:list-block>
			</fo:block>
			<fo:block>
				that the <fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-style="italic">Named Insured</fo:inline> reasonably believes will have a material adverse
				effect upon the <fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-style="italic">Named Insured’s</fo:inline> reputation.
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-body>
			</fo:list-item>
			<fo:list-item space-after="4mm">
			<fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:block font-weight="bold">
				•
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:list-item-body start-indent="14mm">
			<fo:block>
				<fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-style="italic">Crisis Event Expenses</fo:inline> mean reasonable: (a)fees; (b)costs; and (3) expenses
				incurred by the <fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-style="italic">Named Insured</fo:inline> for consulting services provided by a
				public relations firm to the <fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-style="italic">Named Insured</fo:inline> in response to a <fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-style="italic">Crisis
				Event</fo:inline>.
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-body>
			</fo:list-item>
			<fo:list-item space-after="4mm">
			<fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:block font-weight="bold">
				•
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:list-item-body start-indent="14mm">
			<fo:block>
				<fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-style="italic">Totally and Permanently Disabled</fo:inline> means that the <fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-style="italic">Insured</fo:inline> is so disabled
				as to be wholly prevented from rendering <fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-style="italic">Professional Services</fo:inline> provided
				that such disability:
			</fo:block>
			<fo:block>
			<fo:list-block>
			<fo:list-item>
			<fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:block>
				(a)
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:list-item-body start-indent="21mm">
			<fo:block>
				has existed continuously for not less than six months; and
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-body>
			</fo:list-item>
			<fo:list-item>
			<fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:block>
				(b)
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:list-item-body start-indent="21mm">
			<fo:block>
				is reasonably expected to be continuous and permanent.
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-body>
			</fo:list-item>
			</fo:list-block>
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-body>
			</fo:list-item>
			</fo:list-block>
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-body>
			</fo:list-item>
			<fo:list-item>
			<fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:block>
				12.
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:list-item-body start-indent="7mm">
			<fo:block space-after="4mm">
				Section V., Exclusion 1., is deleted in its entirety and replaced with the following:
			</fo:block>
			<fo:block>
			<fo:list-block>
			<fo:list-item>
			<fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:block>
				1.
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:list-item-body start-indent="14mm">
			<fo:block>
				a: (a) dishonest; (b) intentional; (c) fraudulent; (d) criminal; or (e)
				malicious act or omission or any intentional or knowing violation of
				law by any <fo:inline font-weight="bold">Insured.</fo:inline> However:
			</fo:block>
			<fo:block>
			<fo:list-block>
			<fo:list-item>
			<fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:block>
				(a)
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:list-item-body start-indent="21mm">
			<fo:block>
				the <fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-style="italic">Insurer</fo:inline> will provide the <fo:inline font-weight="bold">Insured</fo:inline> with a defense of such Claim; and
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-body>
			</fo:list-item>
			<fo:list-item>
			<fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:block>
				(b)
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:list-item-body >
			
			<fo:block start-indent="21mm">pay <fo:inline font-weight="bold">Defense Expenses</fo:inline> for any such <fo:inline font-weight="bold">Claim;</fo:inline></fo:block>
			<fo:block start-indent="15mm" margin-top="3mm">until there is a: (1) judgment; (2) final adjudication; (3) adverse admission by an <fo:inline font-weight="bold">Insured;</fo:inline> or (4) a finding of fact against an <fo:inline font-weight="bold">Insured</fo:inline> as to such conduct.</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-body>
			</fo:list-item>
			</fo:list-block>
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-body>
			</fo:list-item>
			</fo:list-block>
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-body>
			</fo:list-item>
			</fo:list-block>
			</fo:block>
			
			<fo:block margin-top="40mm"/>
             <fo:block  font-size="10px" color="grey" text-align="left">ISMIE AAA-04-F005 (04012022)
       	 		<fo:block margin-top="-0.5cm" font-size="10px" color="grey" text-align="right">Page 4 of 5</fo:block>
       	 	</fo:block>
