			<fo:block text-align="center" color="grey" font-size="12px">THIS ENDORSEMENT CHANGES THE POLICY, Please READ IT CAREFULLY.</fo:block>
			
			
			<fo:block margin-top="10mm"/> 
				<fo:block start-indent="15mm" space-after="">This exclusion shall not apply to an <fo:inline font-weight="bold">Insured</fo:inline> who, in fact, did not personally: (a) commit; (b) direct; or (c) participate in committing a:</fo:block>
			<fo:block start-indent="15mm">(1)&#160;&#160;dishonest;</fo:block>
			<fo:block start-indent="15mm">(2)&#160;&#160;intentional;</fo:block>
			<fo:block start-indent="15mm">(3)&#160;&#160;fraudulent;</fo:block>
			<fo:block start-indent="15mm">(4)&#160;&#160;criminal; or</fo:block>
			<fo:block start-indent="15mm">(5)&#160;&#160;malicious;</fo:block>
			<fo:block start-indent="15mm" space-after="4mm">act or omission or any intentional or knowing violation of law.</fo:block>
		 
			<fo:block space-after="4mm">
			<fo:list-block>
			<fo:list-item>
			<fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:block>
				13.
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:list-item-body start-indent="7mm">
			<fo:block space-after="4mm">
				Section VI., General Conditions, is amended by addition of the following:
			</fo:block>
			<fo:block>
			<fo:list-block>
			<fo:list-item>
			<fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:block font-weight="bold">
				•
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-label>
			<fo:list-item-body start-indent="14mm">
			<fo:block font-weight="bold" space-after="4mm">
				Liberalization
			</fo:block>
			<fo:block>
				If during the <fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-style="italic">Policy Period</fo:inline>, the <fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-style="italic">Insurer</fo:inline> adopts any provision that
				would broaden the coverage under this policy without an additional
				premium charge, the broadened coverage shall automatically apply to
				this policy.
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-body>
			</fo:list-item>
			</fo:list-block>
			</fo:block>
			</fo:list-item-body>
			</fo:list-item>
			</fo:list-block>
			</fo:block>
			<fo:block  space-after="2cm">
				All other terms and conditions of the policy remain unchanged.
			</fo:block>
